  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "熱力學",
    "sub_ename": "THERMODYNAMICS",
    "describe_ch": "此課程首先介紹熱物理觀念，並定義可量測和其他的熱力學性質，接著介紹各種熱力學性質表。透過熱力學第一定理介紹兩種熱力學性質-內能與焓，由熱力學第二定理介紹熱機、冷機與熱泵等熱力循環裝置。",
    "describe_eh": "Thermophysical concepts, measurable and other thermodynamic properties are introduced in this course. Two thermodynamic properties, internal energy and enthalpy, are defined through first law of thermodynamic. Thermodynamic cycle devices such as heat engine, refrigerator and heat pump are introduced through second law of thermodynamics.",
    "pre_subname": "PHYS1017普通物理",
    "pre_sub_id3": "PHYS1017",
    "pre_sub_ename": "PHYS1017 GENERAL PHYSICS",
